content_md:
man, always sad to see such a great project die off. legitimately this has been one of the best vanilla+ servers i've ever been on, if not one of the best wow private servers period. blizzard's doing themselves a great disservice with how they're treating you guys.

i haven't played regularly in a good long while but i'll always cherish the time i've spent in this little slice of azeroth. bless you torta, and all members of the TWoW team past and present.

ishne'alo'porah. earthmother smile upon you, for now and forever. ;;
